  click A_PUBLISH href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/SessionCoordinator.swift#L462" "App. publishSessionState writes or removes activeSessionState, then WidgetCenter.shared.reloadTimelines(ofKind: NudgeTaskWidget). Nine other app files call reloadTimelines after changing tasks; they are listed under the picture." _blank
  click W_COMPLETE href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/NudgeWidget/CompleteTaskIntent.swift#L29" "Widget extension. perform() fetches the task, sets isComplete and completedAt, inserts a CompletedTaskRecord, records goal activity and saves. Removes activeSessionState when it names this task. cancelPendingNudges reads pending notification requests, removes this task's, trims nudge.arb.scheduledIDs and sets nudge.arb.widgetMutated. Then reloads the timeline." _blank
  click A_LAM href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/LiveActivityManager.swift#L12" "App. Activity.request with TaskActivityAttributes, two updates for the stay-focused alert, and end with immediate dismissal. SessionCoordinator also reads Activity.activities to see whether one still exists." _blank
  click W_STOP href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/NudgeWidget/FocusSessionIntents.swift#L35" "Widget extension. Run by the Dismiss button on a stale Live Activity. Ends every activity, removes activeSessionState, reloads the timeline." _blank
  click OS_WC href "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/widgetkit/widgetcenter" "WidgetCenter.shared.reloadTimelines(ofKind: NudgeTaskWidget). WidgetKit then asks NudgeTaskProvider for a new timeline in the widget extension process." _blank
  click ST_STORE href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/NudgeWidget/NudgeWidget.swift#L301" "The widget opens Nudge.store as widgetModelContainer, from the same App Group container URL the app uses." _blank
  click ST_DEFAULTS href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/SharedModelContainer.swift#L27" "The widget opens the suite by name each time: UserDefaults(suiteName: group.com.deblaser.nudge)." _blank
  click OS_UNC href "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/usernotifications/unusernotificationcenter" "From the widget extension: pendingNotificationRequests() and removePendingNotificationRequests(withIdentifiers:). It never adds a request." _blank
  click OS_AK href "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/activitykit/activity" "The Live Activity for TaskActivityAttributes. The app creates and updates it; the system hands its state to the widget extension to draw; either side can end it." _blank
  click W_PROVIDER href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/NudgeWidget/NudgeWidget.swift#L331" "Widget extension. fetchTimelineState reads tasks, events and completions from the store and activeSessionState from defaults. When the stored session end has passed it removes the key (L598)." _blank
  click W_LA href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/NudgeWidget/TaskLiveActivityView.swift#L75" "Widget extension. ActivityConfiguration(for: TaskActivityAttributes.self): reads context.state, context.attributes and context.isStale. widgetURL nudge://focus-session." _blank
  click W_FOOT href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/NudgeWidget/NudgeWidget.swift#L975" "Widget extension. Three Link(destination:) to nudge://focus-session: Start Session, and the pause and stop capsules while a session runs." _blank
  click W_COMP href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/NudgeWidget/NudgeCompanionWidget.swift#L39" "Widget extension. The mascot widget: no data, a timeline that never refreshes, widgetURL nudge://open." _blank
  click A_URL href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/ContentView.swift#L68" "App. DeepLink parses the host: focus-session switches to the Tasks tab, open does nothing more than open the app, start-session would start a session but nothing sends it." _blank
